                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "About Us"
                            }
                        ],
                        "level": 3
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "We are an online store that was established in the year 2023 with an aim to address mens' frustration with clothing lines that didn't cater to their masculine nature. Since inception we have grown by 78% YTD, this has been a huge milestone for us as we embark on making the online shopping experience intuitive and straight-forward for all men of all ages across the Southern African region. "
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
